en your gaze, and let's turn our attention to the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 31.057, 5.451], "p:Settle in, and let the day fall away for a moment. Together, we'll explore the pelvis, one muscle at a time.": ["g9.mp3", 36.958, 6.609], "p:Take a moment to arrive. Feel the weight of your body, fully supported. When you're ready, we'll begin with the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 44.017, 6.638], "p:Let's begin. There's nothing to do except breathe and notice. Our focus today is the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 51.105, 5.81], "p:Now let your awareness widen, to hold all of the pelvis at once.": ["g9.mp3", 57.365, 3.72], "p:Feel the whole of the pelvis, calm and at ease.": ["g9.mp3", 61.535, 2.681], "p:That completes our journey through the pelvis.": ["g9.mp3", 64.666, 2.281], "p:Take a slow breath in through your nose... and let it go.": ["phrases.mp3", 0.45, 2.933], "p:Breathe in deeply... and as you breathe out, let your shoulders drop.": ["phrases.mp3", 3.833, 3.781], "p:Let your breathing find its own easy rhythm.": ["phrases.mp3", 8.064, 2.284], "p:Breathe in for a count of four... and out, slowly, for a count of six.": ["phrases.mp3", 10.798, 3.869], "p:We'll start with the...": ["phrases.mp3", 15.117, 1.123], "p:Let your attention come to rest on the...": ["phrases.mp3", 16.69, 2.085], "p:Begin by bringing your awareness to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 19.225, 2.001], "p:Breathe in, and on the out breath, we will recenter our minds on the...": ["phrases.mp3", 21.676, 3.808], "p:Now, gently move your attention to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 25.934, 2.092], "p:As you exhale, let your awareness travel to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 28.476, 2.803], "p:Next, we come to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 31.729, 1.302], "p:Let that area soften, and turn your attention to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 33.481, 2.939], "p:Breathing in... and breathing out... we arrive at the...": ["phrases.mp3", 36.87, 2.762], "p:Without hurrying, shift your focus to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 40.083, 2.388], "p:Now let your awareness settle on the...": ["phrases.mp3", 42.921, 1.772], "p:Take one easy breath, and move on to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 45.142, 2.338], "p:From here, we drift to the...": ["phrases.mp3", 47.931, 1.649], "p:Notice any tension here, and let it soften.": ["phrases.mp3", 50.03, 2.484], "p:Simply notice how it feels, without needing to change anything.": ["phrases.mp3", 52.964, 3.563], "p:Imagine it growing warm and heavy.": ["phrases.mp3", 56.978, 1.912], "p:Let it rest.": ["phrases.mp3", 59.34, 0.832], "p:Picture where it begins and where it ends, and let the space between relax.": ["phrases.mp3", 60.622, 4.186], "p:Breathe into this area, and let it release.": ["phrases.mp3", 65.258, 2.302], "p:Let it be loose and easy.": ["phrases.mp3", 68.009, 1.387], "p:If you can, feel it gently lengthen as you breathe out.": ["phrases.mp3", 69.846, 3.041], "p:Breathe in... and breathe out.": ["phrases.mp3", 73.337, 1.66], "p:Stay with the breath.": ["phrases.mp3", 75.447, 1.062], "p:If your mind wanders, that's okay. Gently come back.": ["phrases.mp3", 76.959, 3.167], "p:Soft, slow breaths.": ["phrases.mp3", 80.576, 1.321], "p:Take one more slow, full breath... and let it go.": ["phrases.mp3", 82.347, 2.836], "p:When you're ready, let your attention return to the room around you.": ["phrases.mp3", 85.633, 3.384], "p:Gently wiggle your fingers and toes, and open your eyes when you're ready.": ["phrases.mp3", 89.467, 4.05], "p:Carry this sense of calm with you.": ["phrases.mp3", 93.967, 1.629]}}